// # Strategic Front Door — Anchor for Agents
// Logline: Point at the canonical Quick Cards that govern agent onboarding.
// Setup: Governance repo root. Resolve beat paths from this directory.
// Beats:
//   1. Read AGENTS.md first — the agent engineering standards and entry contract.
//   2. Read rules.md second — the canonical engineering rules Quick Card.
//   3. Read ooda.md third — the flagship CLI surface and workflow verbs.
//   4. Read layers.md fourth — the 8-layer polyrepo architecture map (L0–L7).
//   5. Read spec.md fifth — the language and binary specification Quick Card.
//   6. Read ui.md, security.md, privacy.md, defense.md — surface, capability,
//      privacy, and defense Quick Cards.
//   7. Every card ships as an `ooda <topic>` subcommand: ooda ooda|layers|spec|
//      rules|ui|security|privacy|defense.
//   8. To propose a change, edit the card and verify with `ooda check`/`ooda test`.

